        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>requested_total</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Return true iff the cluster is permitted to reach <computeroutput>requested_total</computeroutput> nodes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The policy may consult <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_shard_limit_policy_1ac9658ac0ff214c8e73d2f2ae84c9c5dd" kindref="member">activeNodeCount()</ref> to make the admission decision. Does not modify accounting state — call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_shard_limit_policy_1a80c72138a5fc0a83d363f69e46f351bc" kindref="member">onNodeAdded()</ref> only after the node has actually joined.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>requested_total</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Intended total cluster size after the pending join. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true when the expansion is permitted under the current policy. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
